#### interp: period, left / right, complex fp, decreasing xp, NaN in xp
ok   interp at 54 points (incl. every xp and both sides): exact piecewise-linear value, fp[0] / fp[-1] outside
ok   interp at x == xp[i] returns fp[i] exactly
ok   interp(left=-99, right=99) used outside [xp[0], xp[-1]]
ok   interp left / right do not apply at the end points themselves
