ok   interp(period=..): left / right ignored ('Parameters left and right are ignored if period is specified')
ok   interp(period=0) raises ValueError  ValueError: period must be a non-zero value
ok   interp(period=2pi) on angles in radians, wrapping near 0 and 2pi  [2.2, 1.8000000000000007] vs [2.2, 1.8000000000000007]
ok   interp with complex fp interpolates real and imaginary parts
ok   interp complex fp with complex left / right
ok   interp with len(xp) != len(fp) raises ValueError  ValueError: fp and xp are not of the same length.
ok   interp with empty xp raises ValueError  ValueError: array of sample points is empty
   interp with decreasing xp [3, 2, 1, 0] at [0.5, 1.5, 2.5] -> [0.0, 0.0, 0.0] (documented: 'If xp is not increasing, the results are nonsense'; the increasing reorder would give [5, 15, 25])
   interp with NaN in xp [0, 1, nan, 3] at [0.5, 1.5, 2.5, 3.5] -> [5.0, nan, nan, 30.0] (undocumented; NaN breaks the increasing assumption)
   interp with a repeated xp value [0, 1, 1, 2] at x=1 -> [20.0]
ok   interp of float32 inputs returns float64
